{
  "provider": "slack",
  "protocol": "http",
  "display": {
    "name": "Slack",
    "category": "Communication",
    "blurb": "Post and manage messages, browse channels and history, react, pin, upload files, and read users — authenticated with a workspace bot token obtained via OAuth (\"Add to Slack\").",
    "icon": { "mono": "SL", "color": "#611f69" }
  },
  "credential": {
    "source": "inject",
    "injects": [
      { "header": "Authorization", "template": "Bearer {}", "secretRef": "slack.bot_token" }
    ]
  },
  "hosts": ["slack.com"],
  "test": { "path": "/api/auth.test" },
  "operations": [
    {
      "grants": ["chat:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/chat.*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.list" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.info" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.history" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.replies" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.members" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.create" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.invite" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.archive" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.rename" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.setTopic" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.setPurpose" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["channels:manage"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/conversations.join" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["users:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/users.*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["files:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/files.list" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["files:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/files.info" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["files:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/files.upload" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["files:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/files.getUploadURLExternal" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["files:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/files.completeUploadExternal" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["files:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/files.delete" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["reactions:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/reactions.list" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["reactions:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/reactions.get" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["reactions:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/reactions.add" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["reactions:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/reactions.remove" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["pins:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/pins.list" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["pins:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/pins.add" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["pins:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/pins.remove" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["bookmarks:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/bookmarks.list" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["bookmarks:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/bookmarks.add" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["bookmarks:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/bookmarks.edit" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["bookmarks:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/bookmarks.remove" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["usergroups:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/usergroups.*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["views:write"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/views.*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["team:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/team.info" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["team:read"],
      "match": { "path": "/api/emoji.list" }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "chat:write",
        "channels:read",
        "channels:manage",
        "users:read",
        "files:read",
        "files:write",
        "reactions:read",
        "reactions:write",
        "pins:read",
        "pins:write",
        "bookmarks:read",
        "bookmarks:write",
        "usergroups:read",
        "views:write",
        "team:read"
      ],
      "match": { "path": "/api/auth.test" }
    }
  ],
  "cli": {
    "bins": ["slack"],
    "binSource": "bundled",
    "dummyEnv": { "SLACK_TOKEN": "x-engrams-managed" },
    "credentialDelivery": "inject",
    "doc": "Use `slack` to interact with Slack from this session — post and manage messages, browse channels and history, react, pin, upload files, and read users. Authentication is automatic: the egress proxy injects the workspace bot token on requests to slack.com; `SLACK_TOKEN` is a managed placeholder. Do NOT set a real token or run any login. Slack always replies HTTP 200 with JSON `{\"ok\":true,…}` or `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":…}`.\n\n<channel> is a channel ID (e.g. C0123456789) or #name; the bot must be in the channel (or the app needs chat:write.public).\n\nMessaging (needs `chat:write`):\n  slack post <channel> <text...>        Post a message (chat.postMessage)\n  slack reply <channel> <thread-ts> <text...>  Reply in a thread (chat.postMessage with thread_ts)\n  slack dm <user-id> <text...>          DM a user by ID\nReading channels (needs `channels:read`):\n  slack channels [field=value ...]      List conversations (conversations.list)\n  slack history <channel> [field=value] List recent messages (conversations.history)\n  slack replies <channel> <ts>          List a thread (conversations.replies)\nManaging channels (needs `channels:manage`): create/invite/archive/rename/join — via `slack api conversations.<method> …`.\nUsers (needs `users:read`):\n  slack users [field=value ...]         List members (users.list)\nFiles: `slack upload <channel> <file> [title]` needs `files:write`; `slack api files.list` needs `files:read`.\nReactions (needs `reactions:write`):\n  slack react <channel> <ts> <emoji>    Add a reaction (reactions.add)\nPins (needs `pins:write`):\n  slack pin <channel> <ts>              Pin a message (pins.add)\nIdentity: `slack whoami` (auth.test). Other Web API methods: `slack api <method> field=value …` (e.g. `slack api conversations.create name=proj-x`). Bookmarks (`bookmarks:*`), usergroups (`usergroups:read`), modals/App Home (`views:write`), and team/emoji (`team:read`) are reachable via `slack api`. A method whose power your profile didn't grant is denied at the network boundary, not authenticated."
  },
  "oauth": {
    "authorizeUrl": "https://slack.com/oauth/v2/authorize",
    "tokenUrl": "https://slack.com/api/oauth.v2.access",
    "scopes": [
      "chat:write",
      "channels:read",
      "channels:history",
      "channels:manage",
      "groups:read",
      "groups:history",
      "im:read",
      "im:history",
      "mpim:read",
      "users:read",
      "users:read.email",
      "files:read",
      "files:write",
      "reactions:read",
      "reactions:write",
      "pins:read",
      "pins:write",
      "bookmarks:read",
      "bookmarks:write",
      "usergroups:read",
      "team:read",
      "emoji:read"
    ],
    "clientIdRef": "slack.client_id",
    "clientSecretRef": "slack.client_secret",
    "tokenSecretRef": "slack.bot_token",
    "tokenResponsePath": "access_token"
  }
}
